敌方英雄或防御塔。","lore":"长期的冥想使得魅影之纱的成员能够谨慎地预知到敌人的到来。","notes":["通过普通攻击攻击肉山会驱散魅影无形。"],"shard":"冷却时间减少%bonus_AbilityCooldown%秒。只要幻影刺客击杀英雄，她的技能冷却时间都会加快0%最高冷却时间。","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"duration","label":"持续时间","value":"30 秒"},{"key":"radius","label":"显形所需敌人距离","value":"500"},{"key":"fade_duration","label":"显形缓冲时间","value":"0.8 秒"},{"key":"active_movespeed_bonus","label":"移动速度加成","value":"9.5%"}],"chips":[{"label":"冷却","value":"45 秒"},{"label":"魔法","value":"50"},{"label":"施法距离","value":"500"}],"type":"innate","typeLabel":"先天技能","icon":"assets/abilities/phantom_assassin_blur.png","maxLevel":1,"hasShard":true,"hasScepter":false},{"id":5193,"key":"phantom_assassin_coup_de_grace","name":"恩赐解脱","en":"Coup de Grace","desc":"幻影刺客的战斗技能得到精进，每次攻击时有几率获得致命专注。攻击时若带有致命专注，幻影刺客会消耗该效果，并且必定产生一次致命一击。窒碍短匕拥有额外几率获得致命专注。","lore":"神圣的一击，茉崔蒂通过赐予对手死亡来向他们致以敬意。","notes":[],"shard":"","scepter":"","values":[{"key":"crit_chance","label":"致命专注几率","value":"17%"},{"key":"dagger_crit_chance","label":"短匕致命专注几率","value":"34%"},{"key":"crit_bonus","label":"致命一击伤害","value":"200% / 325% / 450%"},{"key":"attacks_to_proc","label":"触发所需攻击次数","value":"0"},{"key":"duration","label":"致命专注持续时间","value":"6 / 8 / 10 秒"}],"chips":[],"type":"ultimate","typeLabel":"终极技能","icon":"assets/abilities/phantom_assassin_coup_de_grace.png","maxLevel":3,"hasShard":false,"hasScepter":false}],"talents":[{"level":10,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_phantom_assassin_4","name":"+0.8秒 幻影突袭持续时间","en":"+0.8s Phantom Strike Duration"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_phantom_assassin_7","name":"--2.0秒 窒碍短匕冷却","en":"-2.0s Stifling Dagger Cooldown"}]},{"level":15,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_phantom_assassin_3","name":"+20% 飘忽不定闪避","en":"+20% Immaterial Evasion"},{"key":"special_bonus_unique_phantom_assassin_5","name":"+15% 窒碍短匕伤害","en":"+15% Stifling Dagger Damage"}]},{"level":20,"options":[{"key":"special_bonus_unique_phantom_assassin_6","name":"+200 幻影突袭施法距离","en":"+200 Phantom Strike Cast Range"},{"key":"special_bonus_u